l", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-white", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "o-sluzbe"}, "elements": [{"id": "3774bb5", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-local", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "9720e73", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-local-copy ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "02faf45", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "E-shopy", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b56c1b1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "E-shop, který prodává, ne jen vystavuje", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "698b072", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Úspěšný e-shop nestojí na množství funkcí, ale na tom, jak snadno zákazník najde produkt, pochopí jeho výhody a dokončí objednávku. Tvorba e-shopu u nás proto začíná u nákupní cesty zákazníka.</p><p>E-shopy stavíme na WooCommerce (WordPress) nebo PrestaShopu – podle počtu produktů, požadavků na napojení a toho, jak chcete obchod spravovat.</p><p>Tvorba e-shopu na míru zahrnuje i obchodní podmínky, GDPR, napojení plateb a dopravců a základní SEO kategorií a produktů.</p>"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "0111d0a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-citycard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ccfcc82", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Součástí e-shopu", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b8d7bc1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<ul class=\"ww-checklist\"><li>Katalog produktů a kategorií</li><li>Košík a objednávka na pár kliků</li><li>Platební brána a převod</li><li>Napojení na dopravce</li><li>Obchodní podmínky a GDPR</li><li>SEO kategorií a produktů</li><li>Měření prodejů v Analytics</li><li>Zaškolení do administrace</li></ul>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d71b2ab", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Probrat můj web", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "0554c97", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "prehled"}, "elements": [{"id": "016de9f", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "73aa9ac", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "653f499", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ba203b6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Checklist", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "177ed9a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Tvorba e-shopu: 8 věcí, na kterých záleží", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "50ba886", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Na těchto bodech se rozhoduje, jestli zákazník nakoupí, nebo odejde ke konkurenci.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "8e103d6", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c